(7740127, 1276530, 27608, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this image.  My eye is drawn up the creek and back down it again.  Very pleasing!! 9</td>', 'I enjoy this image.  My eye is drawn up the creek and back down it again.  Very pleasing!! 9', '2023-03-14 19:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7740128, 1276544, 27608, '<td valign="top">Love the golden colour of this!  8</td>', 'Love the golden colour of this!  8', '2023-03-14 19:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7740129, 1276525, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really love the idea -- if it had been clean around the door I would have really loved this. But the haze around the door just really ruins it for me. Could have been a 9, is a 5 (so sorry)</td>', 'I really love the idea -- if it had been clean around the door I would have really loved this. But the haze around the door just really ruins it for me. Could have been a 9, is a 5 (so sorry)', '2023-03-14 21:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7740130, 1276472, 173844, '<td valign="top">Seems hyper-realistic, knowing that this fly is down to earth, loving how the legs and wings fade to whispers, the articulation of the parts refined through millions of years.  The blade of grass, the path unknown.  A strong composition.  Not sure what''s going on in the background, but it''s interesting and I think it works.  Because it''s solitary it demands due attention.  How wonderful that it''s in black and white.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Seems hyper-realistic, knowing that this fly is down to earth, loving how the legs and wings fade to whispers, the articulation of the parts refined through millions of years.  The blade of grass, the path unknown.  A strong composition.  Not sure what''s going on in the background, but it''s interesting and I think it works.  Because it''s solitary it demands due attention.  How wonderful that it''s in black and white.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-03-14 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7740133, 1276556, 173844, '<td valign="top">Rhythmic and exciting.  Triangular geometry on the left, almost fractal on the right, and they seem to stitch together nicely.  The ice is very interesting, breaking up, floating off for a bit, then ingathering anew.  Each piece of ice has its own pattern of white and light gray-blue.  Fronted by a stolid audience of trees.  And those lines of eyes, I mean floats, looking up at us.  There''s a sense of cold mindlessness, but serenely so.  Absolutely artfully seen and crisply presented.<br/>One of four(!) second favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Rhythmic and exciting.  Triangular geometry on the left, almost fractal on the right, and they seem to stitch together nicely.  The ice is very interesting, breaking up, floating off for a bit, then ingathering anew.  Each piece of ice has its own pattern of white and light gray-blue.  Fronted by a stolid audience of trees.  And those lines of eyes, I mean floats, looking up at us.  There''s a sense of cold mindlessness, but serenely so.  Absolutely artfully seen and crisply presented.One of four(!) second favorites of the challenge.', '2023-03-14 22:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7740134, 1276544, 173844, '<td valign="top">The East of imagination and dream, but so absolutely present, which is perfect.  The softness of this image, its delicacy, the recession of planes is arresting. It''s suffused with saffron, calling to awaken to original nature.  Moving.<br/>One of four(!) second favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'The East of imagination and dream, but so absolutely present, which is perfect.  The softness of this image, its delicacy, the recession of planes is arresting. It''s suffused with saffron, calling to awaken to original nature.  Moving.One of four(!) second favorites of the challenge.', '2023-03-14 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7740135, 1276497, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here we are shown the sweetness of, as titled, morning light.  Those reds into orange are a crescendo filling our hearts for the day commencing.  Collaborates joyfully with the blossoming blue sky.  Graphically strong, seemingly simple, but with a webbing of rivets, shadows and metal that draw us more deeply in.  Glorious.<br/>One of four(!) second favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Here we are shown the sweetness of, as titled, morning light.  Those reds into orange are a crescendo filling our hearts for the day commencing.  Collaborates joyfully with the blossoming blue sky.  Graphically strong, seemingly simple, but with a webbing of rivets, shadows and metal that draw us more deeply in.  Glorious.One of four(!) second favorites of the challenge.', '2023-03-14 22:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7740136, 1276459, 173844, '<td valign="top">Somehow, my fault, the entire comment got washed away.  Sorry.<br/>I found this striking image to be powerful, mysterious and very artistic.  Fine composition.  Works well in sepia (I think).  Did I mention powerful?  And beautiful.<br/>One of four(!) personal second favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Somehow, my fault, the entire comment got washed away.  Sorry.I found this striking image to be powerful, mysterious and very artistic.  Fine composition.  Works well in sepia (I think).  Did I mention powerful?  And beautiful.One of four(!) personal second favorites of the challenge.', '2023-03-14 23:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7740142, 1276531, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gave this a 7, now believe I underrated it.  You''re right, can''t be improved.</td>', 'Gave this a 7, now believe I underrated it.  You''re right, can''t be improved.', '2023-03-15 00:15:26.000000', NULL, 0),
