(7740144, 1276535, 67145, '<td valign="top">Erin . this is a work of art . <br/>so delicate and beautiful .. its the sort of image that would look wonderful on someone''s wall . <br/>maybe your own . <br/>although you probably have so many wonderful pieces it would be difficult to choose .. <br/>your home could become a gallery of your art ... pictures hanging on every wall .. busy busy busy .. which i doubt is your style .. lol .. <br/>you are far more minimal .. well this image is at least .. and perfect .. <br/>wonderfully imagined and wonderfully created .. <br/> <br/>btw . although i dont like to give my opinion if its not glowing .. lol .. but i''m not a big fan of the white bird either .. in white or black .. apologies .. :(<br/> <br/></td>', 'Erin . this is a work of art . so delicate and beautiful .. its the sort of image that would look wonderful on someone''s wall . maybe your own . although you probably have so many wonderful pieces it would be difficult to choose .. your home could become a gallery of your art ... pictures hanging on every wall .. busy busy busy .. which i doubt is your style .. lol .. you are far more minimal .. well this image is at least .. and perfect .. wonderfully imagined and wonderfully created ..  btw . although i dont like to give my opinion if its not glowing .. lol .. but i''m not a big fan of the white bird either .. in white or black .. apologies .. :( ', '2023-03-15 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740147, 1276497, 68504, '<td valign="top">what I find so reassuring is that you are letting the light do its thing on the detailed and curved surface, on the dark strut and shadows, and then of course on the atmosphere, softee softee...<br/> <br/>this is what it means to be behind the lens, to contemplate.</td>', 'what I find so reassuring is that you are letting the light do its thing on the detailed and curved surface, on the dark strut and shadows, and then of course on the atmosphere, softee softee... this is what it means to be behind the lens, to contemplate.', '2023-03-15 00:44:26.000000', NULL, 0),
