(7740164, 1276548, 173844, '<td valign="top">C''mon, this is fabulous.  This admonition certainly applies to me, too.  Great composition.  Lovely tree, with some branches catching the sun.  The blues, of course --- set one vibrating in pleasure, you have to feel it.  A surprise that never fails to delight.</td>', 'C''mon, this is fabulous.  This admonition certainly applies to me, too.  Great composition.  Lovely tree, with some branches catching the sun.  The blues, of course --- set one vibrating in pleasure, you have to feel it.  A surprise that never fails to delight.', '2023-03-15 10:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740166, 1276548, 138630, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> C''mon, this is fabulous.  This admonition certainly applies to me, too.  Great composition.  Lovely tree, with some branches catching the sun.  The blues, of course --- set one vibrating in pleasure, you have to feel it.  A surprise that never fails to delight. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Awww thanks, Rich.  First time I''ve ever wished that the annual "Art" show was Standard Editing (I know it was at least once, a few years back, and I was right there with those wishing it was Extended!)  I''m busy this morning, but will try to get back and upload the original.</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: C''mon, this is fabulous.  This admonition certainly applies to me, too.  Great composition.  Lovely tree, with some branches catching the sun.  The blues, of course --- set one vibrating in pleasure, you have to feel it.  A surprise that never fails to delight.   Awww thanks, Rich.  First time I''ve ever wished that the annual "Art" show was Standard Editing (I know it was at least once, a few years back, and I was right there with those wishing it was Extended!)  I''m busy this morning, but will try to get back and upload the original.', '2023-03-15 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740170, 1276535, 75585, '<td valign="top"><img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27608" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">wolf</a> and <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">roz</a> I agree on the bird and appreciate the feedback as it validates my gut; I was on the fence even entering this.  Literally was checking the box and added that bird after the faint birds I had flying I didn''t think would bring it together.  I tried it in darker brown but it was too attention grabbing and since I really didn''t want it there anyway, I went for the more faint color.  I probably should have lightened it even more or left it off entirely but it was moment before the deadline and I just left it thinking that it wouldn''t do well anyway. If I were to redo this entry I would have enlarged the flying birds ever so slightly and left it at that. . .</td>', ' wolf and  roz I agree on the bird and appreciate the feedback as it validates my gut; I was on the fence even entering this.  Literally was checking the box and added that bird after the faint birds I had flying I didn''t think would bring it together.  I tried it in darker brown but it was too attention grabbing and since I really didn''t want it there anyway, I went for the more faint color.  I probably should have lightened it even more or left it off entirely but it was moment before the deadline and I just left it thinking that it wouldn''t do well anyway. If I were to redo this entry I would have enlarged the flying birds ever so slightly and left it at that. . .', '2023-03-15 13:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740171, 1276459, 75585, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Anita!  I loved this one; I think I love all your silhouettes.  They tell a story far beyond the person . . . well done (as usual!).</td>', 'Congratulations Anita!  I loved this one; I think I love all your silhouettes.  They tell a story far beyond the person . . . well done (as usual!).', '2023-03-15 13:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740172, 1276543, 75585, '<td valign="top">Seriously stunning Justin - I love that there are faint leaves throughout to tie it all together. Had they matched in intensity they would have been distracting, but missing altogether and it would have felt forced and out of place.  Beautiful as is!  I would hang this on my wall as it forces someone to linger when looking at it.</td>', 'Seriously stunning Justin - I love that there are faint leaves throughout to tie it all together. Had they matched in intensity they would have been distracting, but missing altogether and it would have felt forced and out of place.  Beautiful as is!  I would hang this on my wall as it forces someone to linger when looking at it.', '2023-03-15 13:41:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740173, 1276472, 75585, '<td valign="top">Congratulations as always you have nailed this!  I love the simplicity of your insects and this one does not disappoint!</td>', 'Congratulations as always you have nailed this!  I love the simplicity of your insects and this one does not disappoint!', '2023-03-15 13:43:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740174, 1276556, 75585, '<td valign="top">So pretty!  I love the tones in this so much; you have a gift for finding the sublime from an elevated position that we don''t get to normally see.</td>', 'So pretty!  I love the tones in this so much; you have a gift for finding the sublime from an elevated position that we don''t get to normally see.', '2023-03-15 13:44:49.000000', NULL, 0),
